  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Indian Oil Corporation Limited Carbon Capture and Utilization, through M.N. Dastur &amp; Company Ltd.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant funds a feasibility study for Indian Oil Corporation Limited (IOCL) , a government-owned oil and gas company in India, to evaluate and develop an implementation plan for carbon capture utilization and storage (CCUS) at IOCL&apos;s Koyali refinery in the state of Gujarat, India. The objective of this feasibility study is to help IOCL identify a cost-effective method to reduce carbon emissions at its refinery.</narrative>
  </description>
